.TH DANBY-MOONTRIP 1
.SH NAME
danby-moontrip \- restricted three-body transfer from Earth to Moon
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B danby/moontrip
.SH MODEL
Earth and Moon orbit their barycentre while a negligible-mass spacecraft is
launched from near Earth.  Speed and direction determine whether it remains
Earth-bound, passes the Moon, escapes, or enters a close lunar encounter.
.SH DISPLAY
The complete Earth, Moon, and spacecraft trails are drawn.  Spacecraft distance
from each primary is plotted.
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/danby/plugin/moontrip.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR orbital (2)
